      "id": "n6mpxie",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "10.2 Important Laws Applicable in AP"
    },
    {
      "id": "mxk4xi9",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "Indian Penal Code (IPC) 1860 / Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita (BNS) 2023 — criminal law",
        "Code of Criminal Procedure (CrPC) 1973 / Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita (BNSS) 2023",
        "Bengal Eastern Frontier Regulation, 1873 — Inner Line Permit",
        "Arunachal Pradesh Panchayati Raj Act, 1997",
        "Forest Rights Act, 2006 — tribal land rights",
        "Wild Life (Protection) Act, 1972 — protected areas management",
        "Narcotic Drugs and Psychotropic Substances Act (NDPS), 1985",
        "Arms Act, 1959 — licensing of firearms",
        "Prevention of Corruption Act, 1988",
        "Protection of Children from Sexual Offences (POCSO) Act, 2012",
        "Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes (Prevention of Atrocities) Act, 1989"
      ]
    },
